{"title": "try_files 配 alias：debug 日志实证", "lines": [
  {"t": "config", "s": "location /images/ { alias /data/uploads/; try_files $uri =404; }"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -si localhost/images/logo.png | head -1"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "HTTP/1.1 200 OK"},
  {"t": "cmd", "s": "curl -si localhost/images/nope.png | head -1"},
  {"t": "out", "s": "HTTP/1.1 404 Not Found"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "debug 日志：trying to use file: \"nope.png\""},
  {"t": "note", "s": "  检查路径 \"/data/uploads/nope.png\"，单斜杠正确拼装"},
  {"t": "note", "s": "实测环境：nginx:alpine 容器 (nginx/1.31.5)，debug 级日志"}
]}
